---
permalink: "til/"
title: "Today I Learned"
description: "Short field notes about frontend engineering and design systems."
---

<script webc:setup>
  const notes = $data.collections.til.map(({ data, url }) => ({ ...data, url })).sort((a, b) => b.date - a.date);
  const formatDate = (date) => date.toLocaleDateString("en-US", { month: "short", day: "numeric", year: "numeric", timeZone: "UTC" });
</script>

<article class="til-page" webc:root="override">
  <header class="page-header">
    <p class="eyebrow">Field notes</p>
    <h1 class="page-title">Today I learned.</h1>
    <p class="page-lead">Small discoveries worth keeping: implementation details, useful patterns and ideas to revisit.</p>
  </header>
  <section class="page-section" aria-labelledby="notes-title">
    <h2 id="notes-title">Notebook</h2>
    <ul class="til-list" role="list">
      <li webc:for="note of notes">
          <div class="writing-meta"><time :datetime="note.date.toISOString()" @text="formatDate(note.date)"></time></div>
        <div>
          <a class="writing-title" :href="note.url" @text="note.title"></a>
          <p class="writing-summary" @text="note.description"></p>
        </div>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </section>
</article>
